<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Seartec listing moved to electronics sector.</title>
<headline>Seartec listing moved to electronics sector.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The listing of Seartec Ltd on the Johannesburg Stock Exchange will be transferred to the electronics and electrical sector on Wednesday, the company said.</p>
<p>It said the stores sector, in which it had been originally listed, had become inappropriate and misrepresented the nature of the company's business.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
